+    lines.append("")
+    lines.append("MEASURED. The base rows, coefficient fields, and final exact standard bases for the three `(25,15)` strata were not reached in this bounded run. The exact stuck systems are the residual TSVs and JSON audits listed in `box/preprocess-native-20260903/results/`; where the Q stage timed out, the partial pivot TSV is retained and no mathematical emptiness claim is made.")
+    lines.append("")
